# Text is stored with LF in the repository, whatever a checkout uses (git's autocrlf on Windows turns it to CRLF in
# the working folder). Binary formats are never touched.
* text=auto
*.glb binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.zip binary
*.blend binary
